  "product_name_en": "UAV Maritime Patrol",
  "summary": "海防日常巡逻可精准满足警用定点范围内的精细巡检需求，有效替代或协助现有警用装备与执勤人员开展常态化巡防任务，大幅减轻一线值守压力。通过搭载双光红外吊舱等设备，可实现全天候、远距离实时监控，画面与数据同步回传指挥平台。同时支持远程下达任务指令，依托高空喊话器开展警示劝导、法律宣传、现场驱离等执法操作，提升海防巡逻管控的智能化水平与应急处置能力。",
  "summary_en": "Routine maritime patrol accurately meets the requirements for precise inspection within fixed police-designated areas, effectively replacing or assisting existing equipment and personnel in routine patrol tasks, significantly reducing the pressure on frontline-duty staff. Equipped with dual-light infrared pods, it achieves all-weather, long-distance real-time monitoring with synchronous data transmission to the command platform. It supports remote task issuance and law enforcement operations such as warning, legal publicity, and site removal using high-altitude loudspeakers, enhancing the intelligence and emergency response capabilities of maritime defense.",
