  "detail_html_en": "<h4>Airport Defense Details</h4><p>Airports are highly sensitive areas for anti-UAV operations, requiring extreme precision in frequency control. Our system neutralizes illegal drones without interfering with tower communications or navigation beacons.</p><ul><li>Protecting takeoff/landing clearance</li><li>Multi-layered linkage response</li><li>Real-time recording and evidence storage</li></ul>",
